{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"c2a2c8075ced18ee889b1f748446fbcb0aedee74df3b48c741b4e887b9daec45","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1067},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"約伯回答耶和華說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道，你萬事都能做；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的旨意不能攔阻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰用無知的言語使你的旨意隱藏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所說的是我不明白的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些事太奇妙，是我不知道的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你聽我，我要說話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我問你，求你指示我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從前風聞有你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在親眼看見你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我厭惡自己","poem":1},{"noteId":25},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在塵土和爐灰中懊悔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["結尾"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和華對約伯說話以後，就對提幔人以利法說：「我的怒氣向你和你兩個朋友發作，因為你們議論我不如我的僕人約伯說的是。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["現在你們要取七隻公牛，七隻公羊，到我僕人約伯那裏去，為自己獻上燔祭，我的僕人約伯就為你們祈禱。我因悅納他，就不按你們的愚妄辦你們。你們議論我，不如我的僕人約伯說的是。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["於是提幔人以利法、書亞人比勒達、拿瑪人瑣法照着耶和華所吩咐的去行；耶和華就悅納約伯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["約伯為他的朋友祈禱。耶和華就使約伯從苦境",{"noteId":26},"轉回，並且耶和華賜給他的比他從前所有的加倍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["約伯的弟兄、姊妹，和以先所認識的人都來見他，在他家裏一同吃飯；又論到耶和華所降與他的一切災禍，都為他悲傷安慰他。每人也送他一塊銀子和一個金環。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["這樣，耶和華後來賜福給約伯比先前更多。他有一萬四千羊，六千駱駝，一千對牛，一千母驢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他也有七個兒子，三個女兒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他給長女起名叫耶米瑪，次女叫基洗亞，三女叫基連‧哈樸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["在那全地的婦女中找不着像約伯的女兒那樣美貌。她們的父親使她們在弟兄中得產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["此後，約伯又活了一百四十年，得見他的兒孫，直到四代。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["這樣，約伯年紀老邁，日子滿足而死。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":25,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：我的言語","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":6}},{"noteId":26,"caller":"-","text":"原文是擄掠","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOB/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}